<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83865" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλήσ-μιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hices.
		</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
			Ath.
			7.298b
		</span></i>, but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Xenocr.
		</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
			Orib.
			2.58.49
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>filling,
				satisfying,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδέσματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Tim.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			, cf. Philistion ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				3.115d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				89.9
			</span></i>, Hices.l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Xenocr.
			</span></i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.8
			</span></i>; of wine, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				1.32f
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ π.</span>”
				<i>satiety, surfeit,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					465
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				24
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχειτι π. τὸ πρᾶγμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Agathin.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				10.7.22
			</span></i>: neut. as Adv., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλήσμιον διαιτᾶσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ruf.
					<u>Sat.Gon.</u>
					33
				</span></i>
			.</div>
